fn ode_chacha20_double_round_4x
machine arm64
i 0 4 .ldr128 0 .x0 0x0
i 4 8 .ldr128 1 .x0 0x10
i 8 12 .ldr128 2 .x0 0x20
i 12 16 .ldr128 3 .x0 0x30
i 16 20 .add4s 0 0 1
i 20 24 .eor 4 3 0
i 24 28 .rev32 4 4
i 28 32 .add4s 2 2 4
